<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <style>
    body { font-family: sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f4; padding: 20px; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd; }
    .header { color: #333; text-align: center; }
    .btn-container { text-align: center; margin: 30px 0; }
    .btn { background-color: #000; color: #fff; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="header">You're Verified!</h2>
    <p>Your email has been successfully verified. We are thrilled to have you on board.</p>
    <p>You can now log in and start using all the features of the platform.</p>
    
    <div class="btn-container">
      <a href="{{loginLink}}" class="btn">Go to Login</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
